.TH DEPLOY-NEXUS-MCP 1 "2026-11-08" "Homelab" "Operator Commands"
.SH NAME
deploy-nexus-mcp \- synchronize Nexus Hermes MCP definitions from Git
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python3 shared/hermes/deploy-nexus-mcp.py
.BR check | apply
.RI [ --source " FILE" ]
.RI [ --live " FILE" ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Checks or atomically replaces the top-level mcp_servers
section of Nexus Hermes config.yaml using the Git-managed
nexus-mcp.yaml file.
Unrelated configuration sections are preserved.
The gateway is not restarted automatically.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B check
Compare the source and live MCP definitions without writing.
.TP
.B apply
Apply changed definitions while preserving file ownership
and permissions.
.TP
.B --source FILE
Override the Git source path.
.TP
.B --live FILE
Override the live configuration path.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success; 2 for configuration drift in check mode;
1 for other failures.
.SH DEPENDENCIES
Python 3 and PyYAML.
.SH SEE ALSO
shared/hermes/README.md
